  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 2527682,
  "published": "2026-10-30T08:54:22.557Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-preview.6: generation reports with stable diagnostic codes, element paths and timings; cancellation, GeneratePdfAsync and resource limits (MaxImageBytes, MaxImagePixels, GenerationTimeout, ResourceLimitException); font weights (SemiBold, ExtraBold); row and header padding, vertically merged rows split across pages (MergedRowsSplit), Extend, MinWidth/MaxWidth/MinHeight/MaxHeight and Rotate; page decorations, header/footer rules, per-cell borders, hyperlinks, bookmarks, headings, table of contents, cross-references, SVG, charts, hyphenation and widow/orphan control. Behaviour changes: MaxPages now throws ResourceLimitException (still a LayoutException); vertically merged rows taller than a page are now split by default (WithMergedRowsSplit(MergedRowsSplit.Never) restores the old behaviour). 0.1.0-preview.5: improved NuGet README quick start and current capabilities; expanded packaged user guide with designer marketplace names and links. 0.1.0-preview.4: absolute positioning (Compose.Canvas free areas and Compose.At, PageBuilder.Overlay for elements at page coordinates on every page). 0.1.0-preview.3: page background images (PageBuilder.BackgroundImage with Cover/Contain/Stretch fit and opacity, for letterheads and watermarks) and Document.GenerateImages(dpi) to render pages as PNG. 0.1.0-preview.2: merged cells (MergeCellsHorizontally/Vertically, MergeCells, MergeAndCenter), diagonal cells (WithDiagonalBorder, DiagonalHeaderCell), rounded borders, backgrounds and table outlines, justified text (Justify, HorizontalAlignment.Justify), superscript/subscript, VerticalAlignment.Center (Middle kept as obsolete alias). Licensed under Apache-2.0; third-party components keep their own licenses (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).",
